cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this fil
  When citing GRUPS-rs within a scientific publication, please also cite the
  associated paper linked in the preferred-citation entry, and consider also
  citing the original GRUPS publication, which is listed under references.
title: GRUPS-rs
type: software
version: 0.5.2
date-released: "2026-08-10"
authors:
